  "<b>Leyenda: el recorrido paso a paso</b>": "<b>Legend: the path step by step</b>",
  "<b>Abre la pagina</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">El navegador descarga la pagina estatica de CloudFront. El bucket es privado: solo CloudFront lo lee (OAC).</span>": "<b>Opens the page</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The browser loads the static page from CloudFront. The bucket is private: only CloudFront can read it (OAC).</span>",
  "<b>Inicia sesion</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Cognito redirige a Identity Center por SAML; la persona entra con MFA y vuelve con un access_token y un id_token (PKCE).</span>": "<b>Signs in</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Cognito redirects to Identity Center over SAML; the person signs in with MFA and comes back with an access_token and an id_token (PKCE).</span>",
  "<b>Pide el acceso</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">El formulario va al runtime de AgentCore con el access_token. El autorizador JWT lo valida; la persona sale del token, no del formulario.</span>": "<b>Requests access</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The form goes to the AgentCore runtime with the access_token. The JWT authorizer validates it; the person comes from the token, not from the form.</span>",
  "<b>El agente propone</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Chequeos previos, modelo en Bedrock y tres capas de validacion (lista negra, Access Analyzer, simulador). El agente no tiene escritura en IAM.</span>": "<b>The agent proposes</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Pre-checks, the model in Bedrock and three validation layers (deny list, Access Analyzer, simulator). The agent cannot write to IAM.</span>",
  "<b>Queda registrada</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">El runtime escribe la fila en DynamoDB con estado 'propuesta'.</span>": "<b>It is recorded</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The runtime writes the row to DynamoDB with state 'propuesta' (proposed).</span>",
  "<b>Un humano aprueba</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">El aprobador entra con su permission set y firma la peticion a la URL de la Lambda. La Lambda lee quien firma, separa personas, revalida y escribe 'aprobada'.</span>": "<b>A human approves</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The approver signs in with their permission set and signs the request to the Lambda URL. The Lambda reads who signed, keeps people separate, revalidates and writes 'aprobada' (approved).</span>",
  "<b>Se aplica</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">El stream dispara al aplicador, que crea el rol de la persona con el Techo como boundary, confianza solo para su sub y caducidad; escribe 'aplicada'.</span>": "<b>It is applied</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The stream triggers the applier, which creates the person's role with Techo as its boundary, trust only for their sub, and an expiry; writes 'aplicada' (applied).</span>",
  "<b>Se avisa</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Cada estado final dispara la Lambda de avisos, que manda por SES el id, el estado y, si aplica, el rol y el vencimiento.</span>": "<b>The person is notified</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Every final state triggers the notices Lambda, which sends the id, the state and, when applied, the role and its expiry through SES.</span>",
  "<b>Usa el acceso</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">La pagina canjea el id_token en STS por credenciales del rol, que caducan a las horas pedidas.</span>": "<b>Uses the access</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">The page exchanges the id_token in STS for the role's credentials, which expire after the hours requested.</span>",
  "<b>Si el aplicador falla</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Tres intentos; el evento va a la cola, la alarma salta y SNS avisa al operador por correo.</span>": "<b>If the applier fails</b><br><span style=\"color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));\">Three attempts; the event goes to the queue, the alarm fires and SNS emails the operator.</span>",
  "<b>Lineas</b><br>Continua: llamada o escritura, en el sentido de la flecha.<br><font color=\"#D13212\">Discontinua roja: camino de fallo.</font><br>Cajas con borde rosa: cuentas de AWS. Borde turquesa discontinuo: region.<br>Fuera del dibujo: el bucket de paquetes, el rol de despliegue y los permission sets Operador y Lectura.": "<b>Lines</b><br>Solid: a call or a write, in the direction of the arrow.<br><font color=\"#D13212\">Red dashed: failure path.</font><br>Pink border: AWS accounts. Dashed teal border: region.<br>Left out: the package bucket, the deployment role and the Operador and Lectura permission sets."
 }
